      <activity id="933cc57d-70db-5f4d-b39b-1e1aa852eb10" activityNameId="713b0b9d-77c4-59a6-bcde-0214362aec52" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium sulphate, powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium sulphate, powder, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of aluminum sulfate. Quite a large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 010043-01-3; 
UUID: 548c4bd3-cf47-3c33-af07-9165c9c84efa
Raw materials and energy consumption for production, estimation of the infrastructure (approximation). No air and water emissions, besides waste heat.
Location: Data used are from one single company in Europe. They are used here for an average dataset for RER (Europe).
Technology: Data based on the information from one European producer. Inventory bases on filled in questionnaire.
Time period: Data from 1995, confirmed as still valuable by same company.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data based on filled in formulaire of one single company - expanded with standard approximations according to methodology of study. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_548c4bd3-cf47-3c33-af07-9165c9c84efa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
